# --- CommandAe2uelThings ---
command.ae2uelthings.help.recover=/ae2uelthings recover <uuid> [tier] - Spawns a new DISK holding the given UUID's data. tier: 1k/4k/16k/64k/256k/1024k/4096k/16384k/max (default: 64k).
command.ae2uelthings.help.getuuid=/ae2uelthings getuuid - Shows the UUID of the DISK in your main hand.

command.ae2uelthings.getuuid.not_disk=The item in your main hand is not a DISK with a UUID.
command.ae2uelthings.getuuid.no_uuid=This DISK has not received a UUID yet (a UUID is only assigned the first time an item is inserted).
